      "body": "Use a default ingestion batch size of 4 accepted records, replacing the previous default of 2. Identify events by the pair (tenant, seq), never seq alone. Preserve original event objects and arrival order. Quarantine malformed input lines into `rejected.ndjson` and continue processing. Never erase existing output to recover a checkpoint."
